WEBVTT

00:05:28.863 --> 00:05:31.347
Zinatokana na ajira adhama,

00:05:31.371 --> 00:05:33.156
kwa mshahara lifaalo.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.938
Ni aina ya ajira 
inatuwezesha kusema,

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:38.962
"Nilichangia ujuenzi wa huu nchi.

00:05:39.522 --> 00:05:43.500
Mimi ni mshiriki
wa ubia umma zake kubwa"

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.522
Huu hisia wa uraia

00:05:47.546 --> 00:05:51.625
Haipo pakubwa
katika maisha ya umma siku hizi

00:05:52.788 --> 00:05:56.565
Mara mingi tunadhania kipato cha watu

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:59.878
ni kipimo cha mchango wao
kwa mazuri kwa wote